# MSMCP worked-example library: five compounds as an MSP/NIST-style text file.
# See "Try it in 60 seconds" in README.md.
#
# SYNTHETIC demonstration data: fabricated peak lists, not measured spectra and
# not a validated reference library.  Its purpose is to exercise the search
# mechanics deterministically.  Caffeine's peak list duplicates
# examples/caffeine_spectrum.mgf, so a correct search ranks it first.
